# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern

LICENSE
README.md

# The frozen openapi-generator SDK. Plaid owns this directory and publishes
# updates to it independently; Fern must never touch it.
legacy

# go.mod is deliberately NOT protected. Fern overwrites it with only the
# generated SDK's dependencies; the tidy workflow then restores the legacy
# SDK's golang.org/x/oauth2. That way Fern's dependency bumps keep flowing.
